# What am I listening to? Pick ONE of these. With neither set, the site shows a demo track.

# Option A: Last.fm (easiest, works with Spotify scrobbling)
# 1. Connect Spotify to Last.fm: https://www.last.fm/settings/applications
# 2. Get an API key: https://www.last.fm/api/account/create
LASTFM_API_KEY=
LASTFM_USERNAME=

# Option B: Spotify directly
# Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard and get a refresh token
# with the scopes user-read-currently-playing and user-read-recently-played.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN=
